{{Wireless embedded system |brand=ZyXEL |model=P-2812HNU |revision=-F1 vT |series=N300 |manuf_country=China |is_manuf=No |manuf=MitraStar |type=wireless router, dsl modem, analog phone gateway |pwr_v=12 |pwr_amp=2 |pwr_conn=barrel |cpu1_brand=Lantiq |cpu1_model=PSB 80920;PSB 80920, EL V1.2 (XWAY VRX288); |cpu1_cspeed=500 |fla1=128 |fla1_brand=Samsung |fla1_model=K9F1G08U0D-SCB0 |ram1=128 |ram1_brand=ProMOS |ram1_model=V59C1G01168QBJ25 |expansion_if_types=USB 2.0 |expansion_usb_num=2 |serial=yes,, internal,, 4-pin header,, 3.3V TTL |wi1_chip1_brand=Ralink |wi1_chip1_model=RT3092;RT3092L; |wi1_802dot11_protocols=bgn |wi1_ant_conn=U.FL |wi1_txchains=2 |wi1_rxchains=2 |wi1_sstreams=2 |eth_cpu=true |sw_cpu=true |lan_speed=1GbE |lan_ports=4 |wan_speed=1GbE |wan_ports=1 |addl_chips=xDSL (ADSL2+) AFE and LD;Lantiq;PSB 80190;Lantiq, PSB 80190 V, V1.1, XWAY VRX208;1; ,,, Single-Chip Dual Channel SLIC (2x FXS);Lantiq;PEF 42068;Lantiq, PEF 42068 F, V1.2, XWAY, SLIC120, UMSWWR5101, H1205;1; |flags=VDSL2, ADSL2+ |802dot11_protocols=bgn |default_ssid=ZyXEL_XXXX |default_ssid_regex=^ZyXEL_[A-F0-9]{4}$ |default_ip=192.168.1.1 |default_user=admin |default_pass=1234 }} {{TagLine|Wireless VDSL2 VoIP Combo WAN Router with 3G USB backup}}
The default SSID for these units would appear to be '''ZyXEL_''' followed :by the last 4 hex digits of the BSSID (upper case letters)
